    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism inspired-by teaching mat: connected creeping branches carry overlapping small scale fronds in two alternate ranks, with restrained submerged root hints. Nominal0.12m patch, muted green palette, shallow lobe thickness and density are art choices; this is one composition, not a density variant count. Basic modern genus architecture and fossil specimen context consulted; original needs-specific-reference status retained. No claim that all ancient species details, exact sporocarps or microanatomy are verified, no marine tolerance or coexistence claim, and no copied Salvinia geometry.",
      "zh": "原创全体inspired-by教学浮垫：连续匍匐分枝具两列互生重叠小叶瓦，辅以克制水下根提示。0.12米名义片区、柔和绿色、浅叶瓣厚度及密度为美术设定；只计一种构图，不靠密度变体增数。已查阅现代属级基本结构与化石标本背景，保留原始needs-specific-reference状态。不主张所有古种细节、精确孢子囊或微观解剖均已验证，不声称海水耐受或共存关系，不复制Salvinia几何。"
